#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:3
msgid "DriveBase"
msgstr "DriveBase"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:7
msgid "Role of the class"
msgstr "Rôle de la classe"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:9
msgid ""
"The ``DriveBase`` class represents the robot drive base. It groups "
"together the four wheels of the robot and allows movement control using a"
" left speed and a right speed."
msgstr ""
"La classe ``DriveBase`` représente la base roulante du robot. Elle "
"regroupe les quatre roues du robot et permet de contrôler le déplacement "
"avec une vitesse gauche et une vitesse droite."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:15
msgid "Responsibilities"
msgstr "Responsabilités"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:17
msgid "Create the four robot wheels."
msgstr "Créer les quatre roues du robot."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:18
msgid "Associate Webots motors with ``Wheel`` objects."
msgstr "Associer les moteurs Webots aux objets ``Wheel``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:19
msgid "Apply a speed to the left wheels."
msgstr "Appliquer une vitesse aux roues gauches."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:20
msgid "Apply a speed to the right wheels."
msgstr "Appliquer une vitesse aux roues droites."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:21
msgid "Stop the robot."
msgstr "Arrêter le robot."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:25
msgid "Encapsulation"
msgstr "Encapsulation"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:27
msgid ""
"The wheels are stored in private attributes: ``frontLeft``, "
"``frontRight``, ``rearLeft`` and ``rearRight``."
msgstr ""
"Les roues sont stockées dans des attributs privés : ``frontLeft``, "
"``frontRight``, ``rearLeft`` et ``rearRight``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:30
msgid "As a result, ``TERBot`` does not directly manipulate Webots motors."
msgstr ""
"Par conséquent, ``TERBot`` ne manipule pas directement les moteurs "
"Webots."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:34
msgid "Ownership and composition"
msgstr "Possession et composition"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:36
msgid "``DriveBase`` owns four ``Wheel`` objects."
msgstr "``DriveBase`` possède quatre objets ``Wheel``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:38
msgid ""
"This relationship corresponds to composition: the drive base is composed "
"of wheels."
msgstr ""
"Cette relation correspond à une composition : la base roulante est "
"composée de roues."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:43
msgid "Relations with other classes"
msgstr "Relations avec les autres classes"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:45
msgid "``DriveBase`` is owned by ``TERBot``."
msgstr "``DriveBase`` est possédée par ``TERBot``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:47
msgid ""
"It uses ``Wheel`` and depends on the Webots ``Supervisor`` to retrieve "
"motors by their name."
msgstr ""
"Elle utilise ``Wheel`` et dépend du ``Supervisor`` Webots pour récupérer "
"les moteurs par leur nom."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:52
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Fonctions"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:55
msgid "``DriveBase(Supervisor robot)``"
msgstr "``DriveBase(Supervisor robot)``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:57
msgid "Class constructor."
msgstr "Constructeur de la classe."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:59
msgid ""
"It retrieves the ``wheel1``, ``wheel2``, ``wheel3`` and ``wheel4`` motors"
" from Webots, then creates the four corresponding ``Wheel`` objects."
msgstr ""
"Il récupère les moteurs ``wheel1``, ``wheel2``, ``wheel3`` et ``wheel4`` "
"depuis Webots, puis crée les quatre objets ``Wheel`` correspondants."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:63
msgid "``setSpeed(double leftSpeed, double rightSpeed)``"
msgstr "``setSpeed(double leftSpeed, double rightSpeed)``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:65
msgid "Applies speeds to the wheels."
msgstr "Applique les vitesses aux roues."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:67
msgid ""
"``leftSpeed`` is applied to the left wheels and ``rightSpeed`` to the "
"right wheels."
msgstr ""
"``leftSpeed`` est appliquée aux roues gauches et ``rightSpeed`` aux "
"roues droites."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:70
msgid ""
"This method allows the robot to move forward, move backward or turn "
"depending on the difference between the two speeds."
msgstr ""
"Cette méthode permet d'avancer, reculer ou tourner selon la différence "
"entre les deux vitesses."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:74
msgid "``stop()``"
msgstr "``stop()``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/drive_base.rst:76
msgid "Stops the drive base by calling ``setSpeed(0.0, 0.0)``."
msgstr ""
"Arrête la base roulante en appelant ``setSpeed(0.0, 0.0)``."